# Working-note markdown — keep canonical docs tracked, ignore everything else.
# Every currently-tracked .md file is explicitly un-ignored below.
# When you add a new doc that should be tracked, add a matching `!` line.
*.md
!loomassist_Roadmap.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!CLAUDE.md
!README.md
!design-wireframes/uploads/loomassist_wireframe_prompt.md
!docs/react-migration-plan.md
!docs/v2-migration-notes.md
!frontend-ui/src/README.md